<mjml lang="en-AU">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Helen, pick your install day</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Your safety check is all clear. Sample Insulation Co has offered three days – tap the one that suits you.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-wrapper css-class="card">
      <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="email-heading">Helen, pick your install day</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Your safety check is all clear. Sample Insulation Co has offered these days for your insulation install. Tap the one that suits you.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-text mj-class="eyebrow" padding="18px 18px 4px">Days on offer</mj-text>
          <mj-table padding="0 18px 8px" font-size="16px">
            <tr><td style="padding:12px 0;"><a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST" style="color:#22376B;text-decoration:none;"><strong>Wednesday 11 November</strong><br /><span class="muted">7:30am</span></a></td><td align="right" style="padding:12px 0;"><a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST" style="color:#3C51C4;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">Pick &#8250;</a></td></tr>
            <tr><td style="padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;"><a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST" style="color:#22376B;text-decoration:none;"><strong>Thursday 12 November</strong><br /><span class="muted">12:30pm</span></a></td><td align="right" style="padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;"><a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST" style="color:#3C51C4;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">Pick &#8250;</a></td></tr>
            <tr><td style="padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;"><a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST" style="color:#22376B;text-decoration:none;"><strong>Monday 16 November</strong><br /><span class="muted">7:30am</span></a></td><td align="right" style="padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;"><a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST" style="color:#3C51C4;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">Pick &#8250;</a></td></tr>
          </mj-table>
          <mj-text mj-class="small" padding="0 18px 16px">None suit? <a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST" style="color:#3C51C4;font-weight:700;">Suggest other days</a></mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" css-class="email-sub" padding="18px 12px 6px">Lock in your day</mj-text>
          <mj-text>To book your day, sign your install consent and pay your 10% deposit of $185.10. Once it's in, your day is locked in.</mj-text>
          <mj-text>The rest, $1,665.90, is due on install day. Or you can pay in full now.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-amber">
          <mj-text padding="18px 18px 16px"><strong>Your install must happen by 4 December</strong>, 30 days after your safety check.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-include path="./partials/footer-trade.mjml" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
